Package: visnyk
Version: 0.4.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Visnyk Team <team@visnyk.local>
Description: broadcast messenger for WA, TG
 Checks number availability and delivers to all available messengers.
 Uses a single personal account per messenger.
 0.4.0: Telegram bulk sends batch-import contacts instead of per-number
 resolvePhone, avoiding the resolvePhone rate limit.
 0.3.0: broadcast file attachments with caption, long-text auto-split.
 0.2.0: Telegram resolve-first send, parallel WA/TG delivery with
 per-channel pacing and FLOOD_WAIT handling, dead-session circuit
 breaker, background health monitor. Delay 8-15s preserved.
Depends: libc6, libgtk-3-0, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0 | libwebkit2gtk-4.0-37
Recommends: libayatana-appindicator3-1
Homepage: https://github.com/visnyk/visnyk
